  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "3Da+sebJAowxScB9XQteq+Jn6r8=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:54.452Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "EPAM Systems is in the Flowable Partner Finder and is marked do-not-pitch on two grounds recorded together: a non-EU base and enterprise scale. The flag adds that it is a dual listing, holding Camunda Silver as well.\n\nThe dual listing is the more transferable observation. When a firm carries formal partnerships with two competing BPM engines, the engine is a skill in a service catalogue rather than a strategic bet, and its listing says nothing about where its delivery weight sits. That is a general caution about using vendor directories as evidence of commitment, not just a fact about EPAM.\n\nThe overlap also concentrates in a predictable place. Tata Consultancy Services carries Camunda Gold alongside its Flowable entry, and both firms are excluded from this brief on scale \u2014 so the directories agree most about exactly the firms the brief has already ruled out. Screening a partner directory by size before reading its tiers avoids spending attention on that overlap.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**9 \u00b7 do not pitch**\n- EPAM Systems (US Newtown PA / global) \u2014 epam.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Non-EU + enterprise scale. DUAL: Camunda Silver \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:54.452793Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:54.452798Z"
    }
  },
